Error [E0320]: typed collection construction uses `[T]{…}`, not `[T].{…}`
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_migrate_v1_bypass.jet:6:16
    |
  6 |     key :: [U8].{}
    |                ^
 Why: D-LIT-DOT1 drops the constructor dot from every literal head
 Fix: write `[T]{…}`

Error [E0405]: `?? return` here needs a value
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_migrate_v1_bypass.jet:7:57
    |
  7 |     recipient :: crypto.X25519SecretKey.new_random() ?? return
    |                                                         ^^^^^^
 Why: a bare `return` needs a value here because the function returns Unit ! Err
 Fix: give a fallback value: `?? return <value>`

Error [E0510]: `core.crypto.expert.migrate_v1` requires an audited `#Unsafe` region
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_migrate_v1_bypass.jet:8:17
    |
  8 |     _ :: expert.migrate_v1(key, Path.from("old.jetc"), [recipient.public_key()], Path.from("new.jetc"))
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: raw crypto primitives may only run inside an explicit expert-tier gate (I1)
 Fix: wrap the call in `#Unsafe("crypto expert: …") { … }` or use `crypto.seal`/`open` instead
